# Hebrew "between" framing -- "בין ... ו..." ("between January and March").
# Pairs with marker_and (ו).
# "בין" (bein): L. Glinert, *The Grammar of Modern Hebrew*, §9.2 -- בין
#   "between", coordinating two terms.  (The alternative "בין ... ל..." with the
#   proclitic ל־ is also standard; here בין pairs with the ו coordinator, which
#   Glinert notes is equally acceptable: "בין ינואר ומרץ".)
בין
